{"4950110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wild West", "steam_appid": 4950110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family rules the town of Tombstone in the Wild West. Sheriff Jeff keeps the peace, Mayor Norman builds the town, and businesswoman Rose runs the shops. Ensure the town’s prosperity and growth, and defend it against its enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild West is a unique simulation game set in a small town in the Wild West. You can freely manage the entire town using members of your family. Build the town, maintain security, and fend off bandits and Native Americans. At the same time, you run the town’s largest store, where you can import goods and sell them to the residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras/e9cba6c1887e8888bfbd02385b1f0288.avif?t=1784063515\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras_big/e9cba6c1887e8888bfbd02385b1f0288.avif?t=1784063515 width=1560 height=684 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mayor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- construction of new buildings, urban development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- hiring settlers for work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- mining and manufacturing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- export and import of goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- development of new technologies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras/c56cf06e5aeb6400a0334aec222d7a4f.avif?t=1784063515\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras_big/c56cf06e5aeb6400a0334aec222d7a4f.avif?t=1784063515 width=1560 height=606 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sheriff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ensures the town’s safety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Repels raids by bandits and Native Americans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Resolves disputes within the town</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Can undertake adventurous expeditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hunts for bounties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras/9d10311b2f19fe8f0ad8c7586b04960a.avif?t=1784063515\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras_big/9d10311b2f19fe8f0ad8c7586b04960a.avif?t=1784063515 width=1560 height=646 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Merchant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- owns the largest store in town</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- can buy and sell goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- manages their store and hires employees</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- deals with thieves and sets prices for goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras/e604b107811c9dd106c19adc3da6b819.avif?t=1784063515\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras_big/e604b107811c9dd106c19adc3da6b819.avif?t=1784063515 width=1560 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family rules the town of Tombstone in the Wild West. Sheriff Jeff keeps the peace, Mayor Norman builds the town, and businesswoman Rose runs the shops. Ensure the town’s prosperity and growth, and defend it against its enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild West is a unique simulation game set in a small town in the Wild West. You can freely manage the entire town using members of your family. Build the town, maintain security, and fend off bandits and Native Americans. At the same time, you run the town’s largest store, where you can import goods and sell them to the residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras/e9cba6c1887e8888bfbd02385b1f0288.avif?t=1784063515\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras_big/e9cba6c1887e8888bfbd02385b1f0288.avif?t=1784063515 width=1560 height=684 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mayor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- construction of new buildings, urban development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- hiring settlers for work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- mining and manufacturing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- export and import of goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- development of new technologies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras/c56cf06e5aeb6400a0334aec222d7a4f.avif?t=1784063515\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras_big/c56cf06e5aeb6400a0334aec222d7a4f.avif?t=1784063515 width=1560 height=606 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sheriff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ensures the town’s safety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Repels raids by bandits and Native Americans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Resolves disputes within the town</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Can undertake adventurous expeditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hunts for bounties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras/9d10311b2f19fe8f0ad8c7586b04960a.avif?t=1784063515\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras_big/9d10311b2f19fe8f0ad8c7586b04960a.avif?t=1784063515 width=1560 height=646 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Merchant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- owns the largest store in town</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- can buy and sell goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- manages their store and hires employees</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- deals with thieves and sets prices for goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras/e604b107811c9dd106c19adc3da6b819.avif?t=1784063515\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/extras_big/e604b107811c9dd106c19adc3da6b819.avif?t=1784063515 width=1560 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Wild West is a unique town-building simulator set in the Wild West. Your family completely controls the town of Tombstone. Sheriff Jeff keeps the peace, Mayor Norman builds the town, and businesswoman Rose runs the shops. Ensure the town’s prosperity and growth, and defend it against enemies.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950110/f8e3c5e6b560cdb6336878ffa7f3